  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pharmaccess - increasing access to affordable care for NCDs 2022 - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pharmaccess works to enahnce access to care and at the same time reduce out of pocket expenditure.
Pharmaccess works on basic research to appreciate actual user access behaviours and constraints - and then to define effective packages of care and financing enabled by digital solutions.

These tools are provided to national health insurance agencies to expand for scale. Countries supported: Ghana, Tanzania and Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
